   "caption": {
    "en": "Durga Puja 2026 themes in Kolkata: Santosh Mitra Square, Chaltabagan, Sreebhumi and more 🎨\n\nThese frames are from the same pujos in the last few years. This year Santosh Mitra Square marks 150 years of Vande Mataram, Chaltabagan Lohapatty's \"Nishan\" is about Chhattisgarh's Ramnami Samaj, Taltala does Bangadarshan, Young Boys Club builds \"Ram Rajya\" from natural materials, Chorbagan turns 91 with \"Beyond Sound\", Park Street gets its first-ever puja, Sreebhumi builds Jaipur's Hawa Mahal and FD Block goes 3D with Gond art.\n\nEvery one of them, with the walk and the nearest Metro, is in the free guide (link in bio).\n\nSend this to the friend who's planning your pujo nights.",
